{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36657","headline":"和禅月大师见赠 · 罗隐","name":"和禅月大师见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高僧惠我七言诗，顿豁尘心展白眉。\n秀似谷中花媚日，清如潭底月圆时。\n应观法界莲千叶，肯折人间桂一枝。\n漂荡秦吴十余载，因循犹恨识师迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}